  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX3-004" ;
  triage:title "Missing rusqlite-runtime test coverage for the task ack path and the other D8 scenarios" ;
  triage:description "Exactly one integration test exists workspace-wide for the task feature (crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/lib.rs ~3469: assign, resend, complete-from-Assigned, one sync Peer no-op). Missing per D8: the Acked path (G1 guard, one ack -> one Acked row), G2 third-party rejection, rejected completion writes nothing, gapless seq verification, fan-out (one row per recipient), async Peer no-op, the AC5 replay claim, and LocalServiceRuntime::task_store() composition tests (happy path and not-installed error; both blocked by AX3-006). Found by rust-qa-agent QA-004/005/007/008/009, ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F004, req-qa ATM-QA-005 on PR #1191 QA-1 (commit 88c579a18)." ;
